# HealthStepTrackerPro

A modern Android health and fitness app built with Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, and DataStore.

Features:
- Real-time step counting via Android sensors
- Activity metrics (distance, active minutes, calories burned)
- Nutrition tracking for calories and protein
- Body profile and goals (weight, height, age, step target, calorie target)
- Dashboard, history, profile, and settings screens

## Build
Open in Android Studio and run the app.

## Notes
On some devices, step counter permission and sensor availability may vary.
